{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-13751" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5x{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-13751" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's introduce the new variable $u={x}^{2}.$ Differentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNext, we determine the new limits of integration:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡3$ |\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5x{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}}5{e}^{{x}^{2}}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}5{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{u}\\,{|}_{0}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(3-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}(2) \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-13751" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec92f9d97684ebf35ef3ad7ff1364e803689d21317e98d44ae75262f69de6d6f"} {"question" "q-13751" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-13751" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡3"] ["math" "3"] ["math" "5"] ["math" "\\frac{15}{2}"] ["math" "\\operatorname{ln}⁡3"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-13751" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int x{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's introduce the new variable $u={x}^{2}-7.$ Differentiating gives \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {4}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {4}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {4}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{{4}^{u}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec92f9d97684ebf35ef3ad7ff1364e803689d21317e98d44ae75262f69de6d6f"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{{4}^{x-7}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{4}^{x}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-31419" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{{4}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡4}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral $\\int x{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's introduce the new variable $u={x}^{2}-7.$ Differentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\cdot x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {7}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {7}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{{7}^{u}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec92f9d97684ebf35ef3ad7ff1364e803689d21317e98d44ae75262f69de6d6f"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2\\cdot {7}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2}+C"] ["math" "{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-73802" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{{7}^{{x}^{2}-7}}{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡7}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the integral$\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Notice that the numerator is proportional to the derivative of the denominator. So, we introduce the new variable $u={e}^{2x}-2x.$ Differentiating gives \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2{e}^{2x}-2=2({e}^{2x}-1)\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u=({e}^{2x}-1)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{{e}^{2x}-2x}\\cdot ({e}^{2x}-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec92f9d97684ebf35ef3ad7ff1364e803689d21317e98d44ae75262f69de6d6f"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{{e}^{2x}}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2{e}^{2x}}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{4}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{{e}^{2x}}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-113873" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{e}^{2x}-2x|}{2}+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-350740" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}x{e}^{3{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-350740" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's introduce the new variable $u=3{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2.$ Differentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6x\\,⟹\\,\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u=x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNext, we determine the new limits of integration:\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $\\operatorname{ln}⁡2$ | $4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2$ |\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}}x{e}^{3{x}^{2}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{e}^{u}\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{\\int }_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{e}^{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}{e}^{u}\\,{|}_{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}({e}^{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(16-2) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-350740" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec92f9d97684ebf35ef3ad7ff1364e803689d21317e98d44ae75262f69de6d6f"} {"question" "q-350740" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32"} {"question" "q-350740" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{7}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14036909/state.json" "file_sha256" "e23a7283fd2343cbcb9e45d73a637cc84d42e734a70e09af64b4f43859f0ab32